2:18.targetText:
And also on My menservants, and on My maidservants,
In those days, I will pour out of My Spirit,
And they will prophesy;

2:20.targetText:
The sun will be turned to darkness,
And the moon to blood,
Before the coming of the Day of the LORD—the great and conspicuous;

8:32.targetText:
And the passage of the Writing that he was reading was this: “He was led as a sheep to slaughter,
And as a lamb before his shearer is silent,
So He does not open His mouth;
